  "description": "Self-hosted, Sentry-style session replay and mobile diagnostics SDK for .NET MAUI apps: session replay (frames, taps, navigation), handled and unhandled exceptions, Mobile Vitals (app start, TTID/TTFD, slow/frozen frames, ANR, thermal) and network spans (every HttpClient call). Buffers locally to SQLite and uploads opportunistically to your own backend, with sensitive-UI masking and remote configuration.",
